   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P8:B16",
   "answer_text": "I am ready, too."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:AD5873B2AE05",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU05",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU05:S004",
   "start_ms": 14100,
   "end_ms": 16600,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P14:B7",
   "answer_text": "Welcome to junior high."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:26754ADEF4AB",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU05",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU05:S005",
   "start_ms": 17060,
   "end_ms": 20580,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P14:B7",
   "answer_text": "I’m Mr Pan, your English teacher."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:ECF35C2554AD",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU05",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU05:S006",
   "start_ms": 20940,
   "end_ms": 23880,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P14:B7",
   "answer_text": "I’m so happy to meet you all."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:583787680334",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU05",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU05:S007",
   "start_ms": 23800,
   "end_ms": 29960,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P14:B7",
   "answer_text": "I like playing the piano, reading books and travelling."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:F00A50B9278F",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU02",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU02:S004",
   "start_ms": 28480,
   "end_ms": 31760,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P8:B20",
   "answer_text": "They are all in my pencil case."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:C3245034B45E",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU05",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU05:S009",
   "start_ms": 35040,
   "end_ms": 39340,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P14:B7",
   "answer_text": "This year, we’ll explore the world of English together."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:8D90F3375570",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU05",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU05:S010",
   "start_ms": 39840,
   "end_ms": 41940,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P14:B7",
   "answer_text": "It’ll be a lot of fun!"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:2A7E8708D691",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU05",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU05:S011",
   "start_ms": 42820,
   "end_ms": 46520,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P14:B7",
   "answer_text": "Now, it’s your turn to introduce yourselves."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:B3802F0C1B06",
   "unit_code": "Starter",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU05",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU05:S012",
   "start_ms": 47100,
   "end_ms": 50420,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P14:B7",
   "answer_text": "Please tell us your name and your hobby."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:447C2207BE79",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S004",
   "start_ms": 31420,
   "end_ms": 33300,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B1",
   "answer_text": "We start to write."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:E5E941206CE9",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S005",
   "start_ms": 34180,
   "end_ms": 37950,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B1",
   "answer_text": "I write down the first word and stop."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:09A24CA126C3",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S007",
   "start_ms": 40300,
   "end_ms": 43850,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B2",
   "answer_text": "But is it OK to point out the mistake?"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:7FA72B13718C",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S008",
   "start_ms": 43930,
   "end_ms": 47400,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B2",
   "answer_text": "Is that polite, in the first lesson?"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:3822D048300E",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU12",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU12:S004",
   "start_ms": 57320,
   "end_ms": 59520,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P28:B22",
   "answer_text": "A project may take weeks."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:2F7466DC3277",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S012",
   "start_ms": 57900,
   "end_ms": 60090,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B4",
   "answer_text": "My eyes meet hers."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:D2D54874AAB0",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S013",
   "start_ms": 60780,
   "end_ms": 63000,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B4",
   "answer_text": "My mouth feels dry."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:DE2FED1E8931",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S014",
   "start_ms": 63780,
   "end_ms": 67800,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B5",
   "answer_text": "But then I think about the meaning of the sentence."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:E48A48CE273C",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S015",
   "start_ms": 68580,
   "end_ms": 70060,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B5",
   "answer_text": "I put up my hand."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:0FD4FC889AE1",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S016",
   "start_ms": 70960,
   "end_ms": 75120,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B6",
   "answer_text": "“Ms Chen, there’s a mistake,” I say."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:BAEF2E4EC353",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S019",
   "start_ms": 85340,
   "end_ms": 89970,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B7",
   "answer_text": "In fact, this is my first lesson for all of you."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:53D73DCC7604",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S020",
   "start_ms": 90500,
   "end_ms": 93680,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B7",
   "answer_text": "You are now in junior high school."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:B39EB99F6731",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S021",
   "start_ms": 93840,
   "end_ms": 96110,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B7",
   "answer_text": "Learning will be more difficult."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:797F1B317A50",
   "unit_code": "Unit 1",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU07",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU07:S023",
   "start_ms": 103200,
   "end_ms": 106100,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P22:B9",
   "answer_text": "That’s really an important lesson!"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:11643789D9FA",
   "unit_code": "Unit 2",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU18",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU18:S002",
   "start_ms": 18160,
   "end_ms": 20280,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P43:B3",
   "answer_text": "It can’t fly."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:259B4B84B5E0",
   "unit_code": "Unit 2",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU15",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU15:S005",
   "start_ms": 30860,
   "end_ms": 32740,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P41:B16",
   "answer_text": "Why do I like it?"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:E1DA42A8F66F",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S004",
   "start_ms": 19140,
   "end_ms": 22840,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B5",
   "answer_text": "John and Robert Taylor are brothers."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:E8E64983FFA2",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S005",
   "start_ms": 23600,
   "end_ms": 26180,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B5",
   "answer_text": "They are always close to each other."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:B818BFF0171C",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU23",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU23:S003",
   "start_ms": 30600,
   "end_ms": 34520,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P59:B12",
   "answer_text": "Every day, she dresses up as a queen."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:A93EBA60EB43",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S005",
   "start_ms": 32400,
   "end_ms": 36460,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P53:B5",
   "answer_text": "This is from my favourite film, Postmen in the Mountains."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:19ECCBA59147",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S007",
   "start_ms": 33540,
   "end_ms": 39200,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B5",
   "answer_text": "He has to stay at home every day and he often feels lonely."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:58281E44DEE3",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S006",
   "start_ms": 37340,
   "end_ms": 41720,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P53:B5",
   "answer_text": "It’s a touching story about the love between father and son."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:51BAF9A95371",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S008",
   "start_ms": 40100,
   "end_ms": 42730,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B5",
   "answer_text": "He wants to join the other kids."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:6AAC7400B015",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S007",
   "start_ms": 42720,
   "end_ms": 47360,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P53:B6",
   "answer_text": "For years, the father served as the postman for this area."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:57698F5971C2",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S009",
   "start_ms": 43360,
   "end_ms": 45880,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B5",
   "answer_text": "He wants to go out and play."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:858DCB635E9C",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S010",
   "start_ms": 47520,
   "end_ms": 51740,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B7",
   "answer_text": "John sees Robert’s sad face and wants to help."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:735A888C6D33",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S008",
   "start_ms": 47700,
   "end_ms": 52100,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P53:B6",
   "answer_text": "He was often absent from home and the son seldom saw him."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:A432EDE71E96",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S009",
   "start_ms": 52640,
   "end_ms": 56120,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P53:B6",
   "answer_text": "But now the son is taking over his father’s position."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:69CEA9734F9E",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S012",
   "start_ms": 56300,
   "end_ms": 61180,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B7",
   "answer_text": "He puts Robert in a trailer and pulls it along with his bike."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:85A461D1F721",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S010",
   "start_ms": 56700,
   "end_ms": 60250,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P53:B6",
   "answer_text": "The father goes with him on his first day of work."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:DEAE82DA5A8E",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S013",
   "start_ms": 62060,
   "end_ms": 66640,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B7",
   "answer_text": "For the first time, Robert feels like the other kids."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:2AE2C7BE8F1C",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S011",
   "start_ms": 65230,
   "end_ms": 71600,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B0",
   "answer_text": "For the first time, the son carries his father across a cold river."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:8E0FD3300A74",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S014",
   "start_ms": 67040,
   "end_ms": 71040,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P61:B7",
   "answer_text": "A big, bright smile appears on his face."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:64B89820364D",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S015",
   "start_ms": 72360,
   "end_ms": 77740,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P62:B0",
   "answer_text": "Now, the brothers often take part in bike races together."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:5FBEF3AE6A72",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S012",
   "start_ms": 72540,
   "end_ms": 77040,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B0",
   "answer_text": "It brings back the father’s memory of carrying the son on his back."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:4918D13BE1E5",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S013",
   "start_ms": 77080,
   "end_ms": 80740,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B0",
   "answer_text": "Tears quietly run down his face."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:369322378B6F",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S016",
   "start_ms": 78520,
   "end_ms": 81960,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P62:B0",
   "answer_text": "It is hard for John to pull Robert’s trailer."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:4A80BD0D1397",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S014",
   "start_ms": 81640,
   "end_ms": 85700,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B1",
   "answer_text": "This film shows a traditional Chinese father."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:494989B5A90A",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S017",
   "start_ms": 82400,
   "end_ms": 86240,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P62:B0",
   "answer_text": "But John refuses to race without his brother."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:66589FC23A61",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S015",
   "start_ms": 86520,
   "end_ms": 88780,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B1",
   "answer_text": "He is happy about his son’s growth."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:E99E63BCC884",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S018",
   "start_ms": 87100,
   "end_ms": 88860,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P62:B0",
   "answer_text": "They don’t often win."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:02113F5F8BCB",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S016",
   "start_ms": 88870,
   "end_ms": 92340,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B1",
   "answer_text": "But he just hides his care in his heart."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:B437FD4E5E87",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S019",
   "start_ms": 89080,
   "end_ms": 94540,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P62:B0",
   "answer_text": "But for the brothers, some things are more important than winning."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:3EED62C9EBAE",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S017",
   "start_ms": 93120,
   "end_ms": 95940,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B1",
   "answer_text": "He doesn’t give hugs or kisses to his son."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:BF79D54313F8",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S018",
   "start_ms": 97000,
   "end_ms": 98740,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B1",
   "answer_text": "His love may be silent."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:6C410BD02B1A",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU21",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU21:S019",
   "start_ms": 99080,
   "end_ms": 102240,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P54:B1",
   "answer_text": "But like a mountain, it is always there."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:275217FA37FD",
   "unit_code": "Unit 3",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU27",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU27:S021",
   "start_ms": 102360,
   "end_ms": 107510,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P62:B2",
   "answer_text": "For the Taylor brothers, the result doesn’t really matter."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:305E62B3B31A",
   "unit_code": "Unit 4",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU33",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU33:S003",
   "start_ms": 27960,
   "end_ms": 30420,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P76:B5",
   "answer_text": "We don’t want to waste food."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:4AEA2DCAAE52",
   "unit_code": "Unit 4",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU33",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU33:S004",
   "start_ms": 39960,
   "end_ms": 44700,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P76:B8",
   "answer_text": "And this year, we won’t have a Christmas tree."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:59703B7F9380",
   "unit_code": "Unit 4",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU34",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU34:S002",
   "start_ms": 63400,
   "end_ms": 69060,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P78:B1",
   "answer_text": "Leng’s duty means she has little time to be with her family at festivals."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:1AE4AD1B6E8E",
   "unit_code": "Unit 4",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU34",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU34:S003",
   "start_ms": 69600,
   "end_ms": 74520,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P78:B1",
   "answer_text": "But she never regrets her decision to be an ER doctor."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:FD5C10E4D194",
   "unit_code": "Unit 4",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU34",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU34:S007",
   "start_ms": 91960,
   "end_ms": 96660,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P78:B2",
   "answer_text": "They give up their family time to answer the call of duty."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:4B7ED2E6DFFF",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S004",
   "start_ms": 24680,
   "end_ms": 28960,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B0",
   "answer_text": "He’s going to start work in the plant."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:A68D922E46D9",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S005",
   "start_ms": 30180,
   "end_ms": 34700,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B1",
   "answer_text": "He works in Workshop 1001 in the Leaf."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:1ED17BAE6F9B",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU40",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU40:S003",
   "start_ms": 33790,
   "end_ms": 37340,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P92:B10",
   "answer_text": "We make chips with corn seeds, too."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:C056913F7DE3",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S007",
   "start_ms": 40300,
   "end_ms": 44940,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B1",
   "answer_text": "They collect sunlight and CO2 during the day."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:4558F7B41148",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S008",
   "start_ms": 45840,
   "end_ms": 49220,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B1",
   "answer_text": "Now workers from the Root send up water."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:F6DFCE30A11C",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S009",
   "start_ms": 50040,
   "end_ms": 53820,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B1",
   "answer_text": "The water will rise up to the Leaf through the Stem."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:71D006524A35",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU39",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU39:S004",
   "start_ms": 54680,
   "end_ms": 57730,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P91:B14",
   "answer_text": "People even use it to make toys."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:E153E2C93FBE",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S010",
   "start_ms": 54920,
   "end_ms": 60350,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B1",
   "answer_text": "Then workers in the Leaf will mix water, CO2 and sunlight."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:1C006D71123B",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU39",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU39:S005",
   "start_ms": 58400,
   "end_ms": 61830,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P91:B14",
   "answer_text": "It’s also part of Mexican culture."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:DB22EDBFD588",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S011",
   "start_ms": 60440,
   "end_ms": 63170,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B2",
   "answer_text": "What are they going to produce?"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:4588E5FD5764",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S012",
   "start_ms": 64100,
   "end_ms": 68100,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B2",
   "answer_text": "Most importantly (for them), there will be sugar!"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:94BA7875A07B",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S013",
   "start_ms": 68980,
   "end_ms": 71780,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B2",
   "answer_text": "It’s useful for the growth of the plant."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:F886D90EF8B6",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S014",
   "start_ms": 72620,
   "end_ms": 77940,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B2",
   "answer_text": "Another product will be oxygen, but the plant doesn’t need much of it."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:9900B2A385C0",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S015",
   "start_ms": 78420,
   "end_ms": 83620,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B2",
   "answer_text": "It means a lot to animals and humans, though – they need it to breathe!"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:DE4CAFC8553D",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S017",
   "start_ms": 87400,
   "end_ms": 89500,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B3",
   "answer_text": "Soon it’s going to get dark."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:09EF5DF728FD",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S018",
   "start_ms": 92500,
   "end_ms": 95260,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B5",
   "answer_text": "There are millions of plants on earth."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:ED9F78952693",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S019",
   "start_ms": 95880,
   "end_ms": 98210,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B5",
   "answer_text": "They give more than food and oxygen."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:B73C0DBF5545",
   "unit_code": "Unit 5",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU35",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU35:S020",
   "start_ms": 98900,
   "end_ms": 103250,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P86:B5",
   "answer_text": "Without plants, the natural world would be very different!"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:35DFF3D2C364",
   "unit_code": "Unit 6",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU45",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU45:S002",
   "start_ms": 33600,
   "end_ms": 37180,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P107:B4",
   "answer_text": "Over the years, he saved many lives."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:D73E6FC50358",
   "unit_code": "Unit 6",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU42",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU42:S005",
   "start_ms": 36440,
   "end_ms": 39630,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P101:B1",
   "answer_text": "I’m watching pigeons in the park now."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:4D19A1A46280",
   "unit_code": "Unit 6",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU42",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU42:S006",
   "start_ms": 40400,
   "end_ms": 43730,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P101:B1",
   "answer_text": "They just knock around –for the whole morning!"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:9A7C502AA1C4",
   "unit_code": "Unit 6",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU42",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU42:S007",
   "start_ms": 44420,
   "end_ms": 46860,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P101:B1",
   "answer_text": "They leave droppings here and there."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:BD629D8F6C68",
   "unit_code": "Unit 6",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU42",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU42:S008",
   "start_ms": 47560,
   "end_ms": 51380,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P101:B1",
   "answer_text": "Pigeons are BORING and DIRTY!"
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:D9D049943DFF",
   "unit_code": "Unit 6",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU42",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU42:S009",
   "start_ms": 52640,
   "end_ms": 54360,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P101:B2",
   "answer_text": "A girl is feeding them."
  },
  {
   "question_id": "Q:050453318270",
   "unit_code": "Unit 6",
   "audio_asset_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:AU45",
   "segment_id": "AR:AU45:S003",
   "start_ms": 57240,
   "end_ms": 59230,
   "text_resource_id": "FLTRP-EN-7A-2022CUR:P107:B7",
